      "message": "During PINCTRL driver probe, at the time of GPIO initialization, a call is being made to gpiochip_add_data which is in turn calling gpiochip_add_data_with_key. gpiochip_add_data_with_key is further checking chip-\u003eget_direction.\nAnd, msm_gpio_get_direction function which is registered with the PINCTRL driver is reading the GPIO. We want to bypass this read from VM at the time of PINCTRL driver probe.",
